00:11:14.888 --> 00:11:17.842
with Bishop Robert McKenna to purge the evil spirit from Bill's body.

00:11:17.896 --> 00:11:21.094
Ed Warren would state, I could sense Bill becoming very troubled the moment

00:11:21.132 --> 00:11:22.242
we stepped into the church.

00:11:22.306 --> 00:11:25.494
The demonic spirit within him was desperately trying to keep Bill under its control.

00:11:25.532 --> 00:11:28.866
When Father McKenna pressed a cross into Bill's forehead, it caused

00:11:28.898 --> 00:11:29.954
him to thrash violently.

00:11:30.002 --> 00:11:33.046
But after several hours of struggle, Bill described feeling the demon leave

00:11:33.068 --> 00:11:33.590
his body.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.810
As I sat there, I felt myself becoming purified.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.182
The poison that had been in my body drained from me completely now.

00:11:38.236 --> 00:11:41.546
The exorcism seemed to work as the book ends with Lorraine explaining

00:11:41.578 --> 00:11:44.254
that two years had passed and that Bill and his wife had been living a happy

00:11:44.292 --> 00:11:46.122
and quiet life on the Southend-on-Sea.

00:11:46.186 --> 00:11:49.514
While Bill may have been set free and the demonic spirit driving his actions

00:11:49.562 --> 00:11:52.634
appeared to be contained, this would not be the last time that the Black Shuck

00:11:52.692 --> 00:11:56.286
got loose, but the next victims would not have the paranormal couple's

00:11:56.318 --> 00:11:58.100
expertise to guide them.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:01.374
(IMPACT)

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.699
 ♪ Suspenseful Music ♪

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:09.774
During their time in Essex, the Warrens bought a book on the Black Shuck

00:12:09.822 --> 00:12:12.678
that was scratched across the front as the Werewolf lashed out in a fit of rage.

00:12:12.684 --> 00:12:16.246
Upon completing the Exorcism, the evil spirit was captured inside this book,

00:12:16.268 --> 00:12:18.806
just as the Warrens have been known to do with other demons and

00:12:18.828 --> 00:12:19.810
spirits that they overcome.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:21.590
Like Bathsheba in the music box,

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.206
Valak in the zoetrope, 

00:12:23.238 --> 00:12:24.042
Malthus in the Annabelle doll,

00:12:24.096 --> 00:12:25.414
Isla’s demon in the goblet,

00:12:25.462 --> 00:12:26.854
the Ferryman in these gold coins,

00:12:26.902 --> 00:12:29.322
the vengeful bride in this wedding dress and many others. 

00:12:29.376 --> 00:12:32.118
The Black Shuck would stay safely locked away in this room where it wouldn't

00:12:32.134 --> 00:12:34.042
bother another soul for the next six years,

00:12:34.096 --> 00:12:38.218
Until one fateful night in September of 1972, shortly before Judy's birthday that year.

00:12:38.234 --> 00:12:41.098
When Ed and Lorraine had to leave town, their daughter

00:12:41.114 --> 00:12:43.834
Judy was left in the care of her teenage babysitter, Mary Ellen.

00:12:43.882 --> 00:12:46.906
But when Mary Ellen's best friend, Daniela learns that she's babysitting

00:12:46.938 --> 00:12:49.826
for the Warrens, who made a name for themselves the previous year when their

00:12:49.848 --> 00:12:53.138
investigation in Rhode Island went mainstream, she becomes fascinated with

00:12:53.144 --> 00:12:56.366
the idea of coming over and trying to get into the Warren's room of haunted belongings.

00:12:56.398 --> 00:12:59.778
Later that afternoon, as Mary Ellen and Judy are baking the birthday cake,

00:12:59.784 --> 00:13:02.354
Daniela shows up for an unannounced visit,

00:13:02.402 --> 00:13:03.522
Coming in through the back door.

00:13:03.586 --> 00:13:06.518
She brings Judy a pair of roller skates as a birthday present and offers to

00:13:06.524 --> 00:13:09.786
watch the oven while Mary Ellen takes Judy outside to try them out.

00:13:09.808 --> 00:13:10.502
With the house to herself,

00:13:10.566 --> 00:13:14.201
She finds the haunted artifact room, raids their office for the key

00:13:14.201 --> 00:13:16.112
- [Daniela] Please don’t judge me.  

00:13:16.112 --> 00:13:20.090
And proceeds to touch everything, including the book containing the Black Shuck.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.090
 – [Judy] What else did you touch?

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:23.070
– [Daniella] Everything.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:26.446
As Daniela explores the room, she discovers Annabelle in her case and is

00:13:26.468 --> 00:13:27.742
immediately intrigued by her.

00:13:27.796 --> 00:13:31.006
She tries to use what she perceives as the power of the room to speak to her dad

00:13:31.028 --> 00:13:33.070
who had died in a car accident shortly before.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:36.638
But Malthus, the powerful demon residing in the Annabelle doll, picks up on

00:13:36.644 --> 00:13:39.678
her desperation and tips Annabelle forward against the glass,

00:13:39.694 --> 00:13:42.018
Leading Daniela to unlock the case and take her out.

00:13:42.104 --> 00:13:43.038
Big mistake.

00:13:43.134 --> 00:13:46.062
Just as she does this, the cake that she'd promised to watch starts burning,

00:13:46.126 --> 00:13:47.214
setting off the smoke alarm.

00:13:47.262 --> 00:13:50.454
Daniela hurriedly puts Annabelle back in the case, but does not lock it,

00:13:50.492 --> 00:13:53.414
allowing Malthus to shove Annabelle forward again, opening the case and

00:13:53.452 --> 00:13:56.546
setting the inhuman spirit free to interact with all of the other haunted

00:13:56.578 --> 00:13:58.802
objects in the room, including the Black Shuck.

00:13:58.866 --> 00:14:01.478
The method by which the Black Shuck was set free is significant to the

00:14:01.484 --> 00:14:02.834
existing lore around the legend.

00:14:02.882 --> 00:14:05.466
If you'll recall, during the previous millennium, the story of the Black Shuck

00:14:05.488 --> 00:14:08.618
became a cautionary tale used by parents to scare their kids out of

00:14:08.624 --> 00:14:10.522
entering certain rooms that they were prohibited from.

00:14:10.576 --> 00:14:13.754
The Room of Cursed Objects is clearly off limits, with no less than five

00:14:13.792 --> 00:14:14.794
locks and a warning sign.

00:14:14.832 --> 00:14:17.086
But Daniela breaks the rules and goes in there anyway.

00:14:17.188 --> 00:14:20.110
And like the early stories of characters who failed to restrain themselves

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:23.130
from their instincts, there would be consequences for breaking the rules.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.686
Judy is the first one to be tormented by the now free roaming demons in the house.

00:14:26.708 --> 00:14:30.174
She screams out for help from upstairs as Mary Ellen calms her down,

00:14:30.212 --> 00:14:33.406
Daniela once again uses this time to explore the house, trying to learn as

00:14:33.428 --> 00:14:35.650
much as she can about the cases that the Warrens have studied.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:38.898
Mary Ellen and Judy later find her in the office, looking into the case file

00:14:38.914 --> 00:14:41.334
on the Black Shuck, and she already seems to know a lot about it.

00:14:41.372 --> 00:14:44.246
She finds a photo of a goat with its throat ripped out, diagrams of people

00:14:44.268 --> 00:14:47.286
who'd been attacked, and notes, as the Warrens had clearly initially been,

00:14:47.308 --> 00:14:49.490
trying to figure out what could be causing these attacks.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.786
One photograph shows the Shuck standing upright, a result of the combination

00:14:52.818 --> 00:14:55.154
of the initial Black Shuck legend with that of a Werewolf.

00:14:55.202 --> 00:14:57.906
There's also a veterinarian chart, which could be a copy of the medical

00:14:57.938 --> 00:15:00.522
record of the dog that died in the fire that I mentioned earlier.

00:15:00.586 --> 00:15:01.454
And they mention

00:15:01.492 --> 00:15:02.282
Saint Mary's Church.

00:15:02.346 --> 00:15:05.086
This is the same church that the Shuck allegedly attacked and killed

00:15:05.108 --> 00:15:06.202
two people at in Blythburgh.

00:15:06.266 --> 00:15:09.294
The girls continue looking at the case files until Daniela pushes things too far,

00:15:09.332 --> 00:15:12.554
turning on a projector that plays an exorcism performed by Ed Warren.

00:15:12.602 --> 00:15:15.054
Mary Ellen shuts that off and insists that they go play a board game instead,

00:15:15.092 --> 00:15:18.366
But they're interrupted by a ring of the doorbell from Bob Palmeri,

00:15:18.398 --> 00:15:21.058
Mary Ellen's crush, who lives across the street, apparently testing the

00:15:21.064 --> 00:15:23.298
water to see if Mary Ellen will let him join her.

00:15:23.384 --> 00:15:24.574
-[Mary Ellen] Oh, Bob.

00:15:24.622 --> 00:15:28.662
-[Mary Ellen] They don't really want me having boys over.

00:15:28.796 --> 00:15:32.294
So he moves to Plan B, returning shortly thereafter with a guitar to

00:15:32.332 --> 00:15:33.730
serenade her on the front lawn.

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:38.198
-[Judy] Bob's Got Balls.

00:15:38.204 --> 00:15:40.482
This apparently works, and Mary Ellen races downstairs to come outside and greet him, but she's too late.

00:15:40.546 --> 00:15:43.474
I guess the Black Shuck was not as impressed with Bob's clunky guitar

00:15:43.522 --> 00:15:45.782
playing as Mary Ellen was and decided to attack him.

00:15:45.836 --> 00:15:47.794
Shoulda gone with Baja men, Bob.

00:15:47.922 --> 00:15:48.914
That's just a joke.

00:15:48.962 --> 00:15:50.334
They did not exist back then.

00:15:50.372 --> 00:15:53.354
He's able to hear the hellish creature breathing in the bushes and senses

00:15:53.402 --> 00:15:56.238
something is wrong just in time to get away and hide in a chicken coop in

00:15:56.244 --> 00:15:58.430
the backyard where he spends the duration of the night.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.246
At first, I thought it was kind of unfair that Bob is essentially being

00:16:01.268 --> 00:16:04.126
hunted because of Daniela's transgression, but considering that there are

00:16:04.148 --> 00:16:07.038
already several other demons terrorizing Daniela, it would make sense that

00:16:07.044 --> 00:16:08.590
the Shuck would try to go after Bob.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:11.586
Many of the characters involved in the initial Lycanthropy stories that I

00:16:11.608 --> 00:16:14.898
discussed in mythology, such as Gilgamesh and Lycaon, were tested to see if

00:16:14.904 --> 00:16:17.358
they could hold back their primal instincts, with the Werewolf

00:16:17.374 --> 00:16:20.050
transformation serving as an indicator if they failed to do so.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.314
In this case, Bob's primal instinct is trying to get with Mary Ellen.

00:16:23.362 --> 00:16:24.982
But there's a clear boundary that has been set.

00:16:25.036 --> 00:16:27.142
The Warrens don't want Mary Ellen having boys over.

00:16:27.196 --> 00:16:30.626
On a subtextual level, the Black Shuck represents a test of Bob's restraints

00:16:30.658 --> 00:16:32.550
to reveal what kind of person he actually is.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.522
He seems respectful when he's told that he can't come in, but ultimately

00:16:35.586 --> 00:16:38.406
tries to find kind of a loophole by serenading her from outside.

00:16:38.508 --> 00:16:41.166
I personally think this is fine because because it's not like Mary Ellen is

00:16:41.188 --> 00:16:43.774
going to get in trouble for having an admirer who she didn't let in.

00:16:43.812 --> 00:16:46.746
But either way, this midnight mutt is going to put the Bob's Got Balls

00:16:46.778 --> 00:16:47.886
nickname to the test.

00:16:47.988 --> 00:16:50.798
As Bob hides in the chicken coop, the Black Chuck lurks outside,

00:16:50.884 --> 00:16:53.686
slaughtering any chickens wandering around outside of it and leaving Bob

00:16:53.738 --> 00:16:55.460
petrified in his hiding place.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.460
 (huge roar) 

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.678
Meanwhile, the demons inside the house proceed to terrorize Daniela,

00:17:01.694 --> 00:17:04.338
Judy, and Marie Ellen, causing Mary Ellen to suffer an asthma attack.

00:17:04.424 --> 00:17:07.858
She does have an inhaler, but it's outside in her car, so Judy rises to the

00:17:07.864 --> 00:17:08.786
occasion to retrieve it before anyone can stop her.

00:17:08.808 --> 00:17:12.166
The house is uncharacteristically shrouded

00:17:12.188 --> 00:17:12.834
In thick fog.

00:17:12.882 --> 00:17:15.762
A callback to the details from Ed and Lorraine's research on the Black Shuck

00:17:15.826 --> 00:17:19.266
having an eerie effect on the weather.

00:17:19.298 --> 00:17:21.362
In Mary Ellen's car, Judy realizes that she's being circled by a predatory entity.

00:17:21.426 --> 00:17:24.378
It shatters one of the windows, climbs onto the roof and slashes through the steel,

00:17:24.384 --> 00:17:27.402
causing Judy to run for it, As it gains on her,

00:17:27.456 --> 00:17:30.746
Bob comes around the corner and uses his guitar as a weapon, smashing it

00:17:30.768 --> 00:17:33.914
across the face of the Black Shuck, which destroys the guitar, but the Black Shuck 

00:17:33.952 --> 00:17:37.118
just dissipates back into fog and then reforms further down the driveway.

00:17:37.124 --> 00:17:40.638
But Bob does manage to save Judy, who locks them both out of the

00:17:40.644 --> 00:17:43.070
house when the creature barges up against the door.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:45.070
(impact and growling)

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.766
The fact that Bob chose to use his guitar, the thing that he was hoping

00:17:48.798 --> 00:17:52.046
might convince Mary Ellen to let him come inside, might be what demonstrates

00:17:52.078 --> 00:17:54.130
that Bob's care for her and Judy is real.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.046
Or, you know, maybe the Black Shuck didn't like his guitar playing and just

00:17:57.068 --> 00:17:59.670
decided to do his best animal house reenactment.

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:04.083
(guitar being smashed)

00:18:04.469 --> 00:18:05.278
-[Bluto] Sorry.

00:18:05.278 --> 00:18:08.054
But the Black Shuck is still not quite done with him and chases him,

00:18:08.092 --> 00:18:10.502
presumably back to the chicken coop.

00:18:10.556 --> 00:18:13.554
Inside the house, Judy is able to give Mary Ellen her inhaler, and eventually

00:18:13.602 --> 00:18:16.646
the 3 girls manage to lock Malthus and the Annabelle doll back into their case,

00:18:16.668 --> 00:18:19.602
which sends all of the other demons back into the possessions that they possess,

00:18:19.666 --> 00:18:21.018
including the Black Shuck.

00:18:21.114 --> 00:18:24.158
Bob does, at this point come into the house, but this time he takes on the

00:18:24.164 --> 00:18:27.566
role of the protector of Mary Ellen, Daniela, and Judy until the Warrens get

00:18:27.588 --> 00:18:28.350
home the next morning.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.246
While Bob did make it into the house, the Black Shuck had really put him

00:18:31.268 --> 00:18:34.238
through a test, and he came out on the other side, revealing himself to be a

00:18:34.244 --> 00:18:34.798
good person.

00:18:34.884 --> 00:18:37.758
Bob further proves this by joining Mary Ellen and Daniela in attending

00:18:37.774 --> 00:18:40.450
Judy's birthday and further encouraging other kids to come.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:44.130
And that's the last anyone sees or hears from the Black Shuck for now.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:47.922
But could we see another curious guest set this commonwealth canine free

00:18:47.976 --> 00:18:50.050
once again? Probably not.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.030
But I do have this idea that I've talked about on my channel before.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:56.162
I think it would be really cool to one day have a contemporary Conjuring movie,

00:18:56.226 --> 00:18:59.926
and the perfect opportunity to do it would be this news story that

00:18:59.948 --> 00:19:03.366
happened in 2020 where it was reported that the Annabelle doll escaped from

00:19:03.388 --> 00:19:06.886
the Warren's occult museum. At the time it was closed and being looked over

00:19:06.908 --> 00:19:08.626
by Judy's husband, Tony Sparrow.

00:19:08.658 --> 00:19:11.486
I think there's an interesting story there with Tony and Judy being in

00:19:11.508 --> 00:19:14.302
charge for the first time, with Lorraine having passed away the year before

00:19:14.356 --> 00:19:17.566
and having to rise to the occasion facing one of the most powerful demons in

00:19:17.588 --> 00:19:21.070
Conjuring lore, all in the shadow of the hysteria that was the year 2020.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.174
If they ever did something like this, it stands to reason that Malthus could

00:19:24.212 --> 00:19:27.566
set free the other spirits in the room again, and I would personally like to

00:19:27.588 --> 00:19:30.626
see them focus on the other evil entities instead of the three that were

00:19:30.648 --> 00:19:32.194
already featured in Annabelle Comes Home.

00:19:32.232 --> 00:19:35.118
But it would be cool if the Black Shuck made a quick Easter egg appearance.

00:19:35.214 --> 00:19:38.466
And by the way, I'm aware that the rumor of Annabelle's escape was just a

00:19:38.488 --> 00:19:41.654
mistranslation from a Chinese website, and Tony cleared things up pretty

00:19:41.692 --> 00:19:42.550
quickly after that.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:45.122
But again, I don't think that means that they can't make that movie,

00:19:45.186 --> 00:19:47.814
especially considering that most of this franchise is just based on

00:19:47.852 --> 00:19:49.938
exaggerated and sometimes made up stories.

00:19:50.034 --> 00:19:53.234
As I alluded to, there are a lot of Conjuring antagonists whose stories

00:19:53.282 --> 00:19:54.262
deserve a closer look.

00:19:54.316 --> 00:19:57.266
So check out that playlist on the left for my deep dives on the franchise's

00:19:57.298 --> 00:19:58.594
most horrifying villains.

00:19:58.642 --> 00:20:01.822
And remember to subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every week.

00:20:01.876 --> 00:20:05.806
Ring the Deathbell and select all notifications, and I will see you in the next one.

00:20:05.828 --> 00:20:08.330
Assuming we both survive.

